### Dashboard API Documentation
### لوحة التحكم - Dashboard Endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json
@employeeToken = your-employee-jwt-token-here

### ============================================
### GET OVERVIEW STATISTICS
### ============================================
### Get overview statistics (Total Freelancers, Clients, Projects, Revenue)
### Requires employee JWT token

GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/overview?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-02-17
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Query Parameters:
### - startDate: Optional, format YYYY-MM-DD (e.g., "2026-01-01")
### - endDate: Optional, format YYYY-MM-DD (e.g., "2026-02-17")
### If not provided, compares with previous period automatically

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Overview statistics fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "freelancers": {
###       "total": 12456,
###       "change": "5.2"
###     },
###     "clients": {
###       "total": 8934,
###       "change": "3.8"
###     },
###     "projects": {
###       "total": 24789,
###       "change": "3.8"
###     },
###     "revenue": {
###       "total": 2400000.00,
###       "change": "12.3"
###     }
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### GET ACTIVE PROJECTS TIME SERIES
### ============================================
### Get time series data for active and completed projects
### Requires employee JWT token

GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/active-projects?startDate=2026-07-01&endDate=2026-07-12
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Query Parameters:
### - startDate: Optional, format YYYY-MM-DD (defaults to 30 days ago)
### - endDate: Optional, format YYYY-MM-DD (defaults to today)

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Active projects time series fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "current": {
###       "active": 521,
###       "change": "2.6"
###     },
###     "timeSeries": [
###       {
###         "date": "2026-07-01",
###         "active": 500,
###         "completed": 1200
###       },
###       {
###         "date": "2026-07-02",
###         "active": 505,
###         "completed": 1210
###       },
###       ...
###     ]
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### GET FREELANCERS BY COUNTRY
### ============================================
### Get distribution of freelancers by country
### Requires employee JWT token

GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/freelancers-by-country
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Freelancers by country fetched successfully",
###   "data": [
###     {
###       "country": "السعودية",
###       "count": 3114,
###       "percentage": "25.0"
###     },
###     {
###       "country": "الإمارات",
###       "count": 2242,
###       "percentage": "18.0"
###     },
###     {
###       "country": "مصر",
###       "count": 1868,
###       "percentage": "15.0"
###     },
###     ...
###   ]
### }

### ============================================
### GET PROJECTS BY FIELD
### ============================================
### Get distribution of projects by field/specification
### Requires employee JWT token

GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/projects-by-field
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Response Example (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Projects by field fetched successfully",
###   "data": [
###     {
###       "field": "تطوير الويب",
###       "fieldId": "uuid-here",
###       "count": 6445,
###       "percentage": "26.0"
###     },
###     {
###       "field": "التسويق الرقمي",
###       "fieldId": "uuid-here",
###       "count": 3223,
###       "percentage": "13.0"
###     },
###     {
###       "field": "التصوير",
###       "fieldId": "uuid-here",
###       "count": 2231,
###       "percentage": "9.0"
###     },
###     ...
###   ]
### }

### ============================================
### NOTES & GUIDELINES
### ============================================

### 1. AUTHENTICATION
###    - All dashboard endpoints require employee/admin JWT token
###    - Use: Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
###    - Get token from: POST /api/employees/login

### 2. DATE FORMAT
###    - All dates must be in YYYY-MM-DD format
###    - Example: "2026-02-17"

### 3. PERCENTAGE CHANGES
###    - Positive values indicate increase
###    - Negative values indicate decrease
###    - Calculated by comparing current period with previous period

### 4. REVENUE CALCULATION
###    - Revenue is calculated from FEE and ESCROW_RELEASE transactions
###    - Only COMPLETED transactions are counted
###    - Currency defaults to SAR

### 5. TIME SERIES DATA
###    - Defaults to last 30 days if no dates provided
###    - Returns daily data points
###    - Active projects = projects with status "in_progress"
###    - Completed projects = projects with status "completed"
